{"id":"wb-7-950","name":"东庙桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:41+00:00","status":"ready","title":"东庙桥","text":"东庙桥，位于中国江苏省苏州市吴江区七都镇东庙桥村横沽塘，建于南宋。\n\n2013年3月5日，东庙桥公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位，编号7-0949-3-248。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%9C%E5%BA%99%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":91849492,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91849492","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":null,"textScope":"body-excerpt"}